        "text": "9/10",
        "rationale": "Subtract the overlap; it was counted twice."
      }
    ],
    "correct_choice": "C",
    "explanation": "P(A or B) = P(A) + P(B) − P(A and B) = (58 + 32 − 4)/100 = 43/50.",
    "estimated_time_seconds": 90,
